        "title": "Coffee That Supports Clean Water",
        "description": "<p>In partnership with <a href=\"https://waterforgood.org/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://waterforgood.org/\">Water for Good</a>, ONA Coffee is supporting the development of new community water points in the Nensebo region of Ethiopia, where many coffee-growing communities still lack reliable access to clean water. From now until March 22, a portion of every bag of selected coffees sold will go toward funding the next water point. Each purchase helps contribute to long-term, community-led water access in a region deeply connected to the coffees we share.</p>",
        "cta_text": "Learn more",
